{
  "_note": "RouteGuard design tokens. Base colours match the Round 1 deck. The *.ink, border.strong and risk.medium.map tokens were added in Round 2 because the base colour failed WCAG for that use (see contrast_pairs). One source of truth: the style guide, the prototype, the Figma plugin and scripts/verify_round2_all.py all read or are checked against this file.",
